14: /// AC-TR-MCP-SESSIONLOG-006-009 (operator 2026-10-20: "Fix scans in PR 87 (Recommended)"; triage report
15: /// b0e41c36). Test data: a temporary profile the test creates, listed through
16: /// <see cref="DirectoryTreeWalker.ListFileSystem"/>, with the failure conditions scripted on top: one directory's
17: /// listing throws the untrusted-mount-point <see cref="IOException"/> seen on PAYTON-LEGION2 as kingd, and one
18: /// directory is reported as a link. Seam controls run the same profile with the link flag removed and prove the
19: /// result changes, so the expected values come from the link and error handling rather than from the layout. The
20: /// version-file cases (operator 2026-10-20: "Fold R3-P3 in first") read the same profile through
